s10-9-p3 : Block
s10-9-p3 = prose (cons "A program interaction may be represented by a typed query or edit operation. For instance, given \(t:\mathsf{Code}(\Gamma,A)\), the environment can compute its type, free-variable dependencies, a symbolic residual under an environment substitution, a proof-relevant transformation, or a selected executable realization. An edit is a function on checked code, accompanied where required by a semantic relation between its input and output. A change to a dependency invalidates exactly those retained results whose observation certificates no longer hold. The object may be inspected at any chosen cut: an expression, function, thread, OS-hosted process, distributed service, or complete fleet." nil)
